@AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Avalonia Headless endpoints (formerly FlaUI)
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/

###
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/initialize

###
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/click?buttonName=StartButton

###
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/readLabel?labelName=StatusLabel

###
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/window-content

### Economy Sim Integration endpoints

### Initialize the economy-sim service
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/initialize

###
### Get current game state (treasury, population, date, etc.)
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/game-state

###
### Get diplomatic relations
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/diplomatic-relations

###
### Get trade data (imports/exports)
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/trade-data

###
### Get construction projects
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/construction-projects

###
### Execute a diplomacy command
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/execute-command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commandType": "diplomacy",
  "action": "propose_treaty",
  "parameters": {
    "targetCountry": "United Kingdom"
  }
}

###
### Execute a trade command
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/execute-command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commandType": "trade",
  "action": "create_export",
  "parameters": {
    "item": "Steel",
    "quantity": "1000",
    "partner": "France"
  }
}

###
### Execute a construction command
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/execute-command
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "commandType": "construction",
  "action": "build_factory",
  "parameters": {
    "factoryType": "Steel Mill",
    "location": "Detroit"
  }
}

###
### Change map view
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/change-map-view?viewType=political

###
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/change-map-view?viewType=terrain

### Graphics and UI endpoints

### Capture map screenshot
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/graphics/screenshot

###
### Get map view information
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/graphics/map-view-info

###
### Get UI overlay information
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/graphics/ui-overlay-info

###
### Get color analysis of map
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/graphics/color-analysis

###
### Capture screenshot of specific UI element
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/graphics/element-screenshot?elementName=TreasuryText

### Analytics and AI endpoints

### Start monitoring game state changes
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/analytics/start-monitoring?intervalMs=5000

###
### Get comprehensive game analytics
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/analytics/comprehensive

###
### Get performance metrics over time
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/analytics/performance-metrics

###
### Detect recent game events
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/analytics/game-events

###
### Get AI-powered recommendations
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/analytics/ai-recommendations

### Automation and Macro endpoints

### Register a new automation script
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/automation/register-script
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "AutoTrade",
  "description": "Automatically create export deals when treasury is high",
  "isEnabled": true,
  "triggers": [
    {
      "type": "Treasury",
      "operator": "GreaterThan",
      "value": "2000000"
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "type": "ExecuteCommand",
      "parameters": {
        "commandType": "trade",
        "action": "create_export",
        "item": "Steel"
      },
      "delayMs": 1000
    }
  ]
}

###
### Execute a specific automation script
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/automation/execute-script?scriptName=AutoTrade

###
### Start the automation engine
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/automation/start-engine

###
### Stop the automation engine
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/automation/stop-engine

###
### Get all registered scripts
GET {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/automation/scripts

###
### Execute a macro sequence
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/automation/execute-macro
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "InfrastructureBuild",
  "description": "Build multiple infrastructure projects in sequence",
  "delayBetweenCommandsMs": 2000,
  "commands": [
    {
      "commandType": "construction",
      "action": "build_factory",
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "commandType": "construction",
      "action": "build_road",
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "commandType": "construction",
      "action": "build_port",
      "parameters": {}
    }
  ]
}

###
### Create AI-powered automation script
POST {{AvaloniaUiAgent_HostAddress}}/economy-sim/automation/create-ai-script?objective=improve_economy
